.TH HECATE-G2000-PRO-VOLUME 1 "2026-11-02" "hecate-g2000-pro-volume 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
hecate-g2000-pro-volume \- system volume drives the Edifier Hecate G2000 PRO hardware volume
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hecate-g2000-pro-volume
.RB { status | diagnose }
.br
.B hecate-g2000-pro-volume
.RB { install | uninstall }
.RB [ \-\-force ]
.br
.B hecate-g2000-pro-volume \-\-version
.SH DESCRIPTION
With its configuration installed, PipeWire and WirePlumber offer only the analog output of the
Edifier Hecate G2000 PRO USB speaker (USB 35bb:b065). Its mixer path uses the speaker's own ALSA
controls, so the system volume changes
.I PCM Playback Volume
and mute changes
.IR "PCM Playback Switch" ,
with no software volume on top. The speaker's + and \- buttons send volume keys to the computer,
so they change the same hardware volume. Other audio devices are not changed.
.PP
The Debian package installs the configuration for the whole system. Without the package,
.B install
copies it for the current user.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B status
Shows where the configuration is installed, whether WirePlumber loaded it, the active profile,
the system volume, the hardware controls and the software volume. Changes nothing.
.TP
.B diagnose
Lowers the volume in three steps below the current one, mutes, and checks that the hardware
controls follow and that the software volume stays at 100%. Restores the volume and mute at the end.
.TP
.B install
Copies the two configuration files below
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME
(default
.IR ~/.config ).
A file with other content is kept unless
.B \-\-force
is given.
.TP
.B uninstall
Removes the two files installed by
.BR install .
A file with other content is kept unless
.B \-\-force
is given.
.PP
After install or uninstall, restart WirePlumber:
.B systemctl \-\-user restart wireplumber.service
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/wireplumber/wireplumber.conf.d/60\-edifier\-hecate\-g2000\-pro.conf
.TQ
.I ~/.config/wireplumber/wireplumber.conf.d/60\-edifier\-hecate\-g2000\-pro.conf
WirePlumber rule: the profile set below for USB 35bb:b065.
.TP
.I /usr/share/alsa\-card\-profile/mixer/profile\-sets/edifier\-hecate\-g2000\-pro.conf
.TQ
.I ~/.config/alsa\-card\-profile/mixer/profile\-sets/edifier\-hecate\-g2000\-pro.conf
Profile set with the analog output only.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 when the check passes or the command succeeded, 1 when a check fails, 2 on an error.
.SH REQUIREMENTS
PipeWire with WirePlumber 0.5 or newer. Commands used: wpctl, pw\-cli, amixer.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR wpctl (1),
.BR pw\-cli (1),
.BR amixer (1)
